E("avantivarman","Avantivarman","Barman dynasty",650,655,"c. 650–655 CE","Last Varman ruler","Named in some lists as the last ruler of the Varman line after Bhaskarvarman; his parentage is unknown. This is the row marked “Unknown” in the source CSV.","Sources disagree on the end of the dynasty (650 or 655 CE).",("varman",),"low",as_="অবন্তীবৰ্মা")

