E("bakhtiyar-khalji","Ikhtiyar al-Din Muhammad bin Bakhtiyar Khalji","Sultanate and Mughal figures",1203,1206,"d. 1206","Turkic commander of Bengal","Conquered Bengal and led a failed expedition towards Tibet through Kamarupa in 1206; the retreat ended in disaster.","Some accounts date an earlier attempt to 1203. The identity of the Kamarupa ruler who resisted him is disputed.",("prithu",),"medium",era="early-ahom")
E("prithu","Prithu","Kamata and Khen kingdoms",1206,1228,"c. 1206 (Tibet campaign)","King of Kamarupa, traditionally","A ruler associated in modern accounts with the defeat of Bakhtiyar Khalji's army in 1206. Scholars disagree on whether the name Prithu (from Juzjani) belongs to the Kamarupa king.","Treat as uncertain: no direct contemporary evidence names him.",("prithu",),"low",as_="পৃথু",era="early-ahom")
E("sandhya","Sandhya (Kamateswar)","Kamata and Khen kingdoms",1228,1260,"c. 1228–1260","King of Kamata","Founder of the Kamata kingdom; ruled from Kamarupanagara and moved the capital to Kamatapur after Yuzbak's 1257 attack. Styled himself Kamateswar.","Sources differ on whether Yuzbak was killed or captured in 1257.",("kamata","yuzbak"),"medium")
E("ikhtiyaruddin-yuzbak","Malik Ikhtiyaruddin Yuzbak Tughril Khan","Sultanate and Mughal figures",1257,1257,"d. 1257","Governor of Bengal","Invaded Kamarupa in 1257, won early successes and was then defeated by the Kamata ruler.","Accounts differ on whether he was captured or killed.",("yuzbak","kamata"),"medium")
E("sindhu-rai","Sindhu Rai","Kamata and Khen kingdoms",1260,1270,"13th century (dates not given)","King of Kamata","Early Kamata ruler listed between Sandhya and Rup Narayan; no dates or events are given.","",("kamata",),"low",sort=1262)
