E("ananta-kandali","Ananta Kandali","Poets and writers",1540,1580,"1540–1580","Poet and disciple of Sankardev","Poet from Hajo, born Haricharan; wrote Kumara Harana.","",("ananta","sankar"),"medium",as_="অনন্ত কন্দলী",birth=1540,death=1580)
