E("candivara","Candivara (Chandibar)","Baro-Bhuyans",1350,1400,"14th century","Leader of a Bhuyan group","Said to have been a former ruler of Kannauj who fled north India; Durlabhnarayan of Kamata settled his group at Langamaguri and later Bordowa. A descendant was Srimanta Sankardev.","Possibly fled after the 1353 campaign against Ilyas Shah.",("baro",),"low",era="early-ahom")
E("rajadhara","Rajadhara","Baro-Bhuyans",1390,1430,"14th–15th century","Bhuyan chief","Son of Candivara; captured by the Bhutiyas, later freed, and succeeded his father as leader of the Baro-Bhuyans.","",("baro",),"low",sort=1400)
